flowchart TB
  classDef external fill:#0f172a,stroke:#020617,stroke-width:2,color:#f8fafc
  classDef care fill:#1d4ed8,stroke:#1e3a8a,stroke-width:2,color:#ffffff
  classDef season fill:#b45309,stroke:#78350f,stroke-width:2,color:#ffffff
  classDef beds fill:#15803d,stroke:#14532d,stroke-width:2,color:#ffffff
  classDef seeds fill:#be185d,stroke:#831843,stroke-width:2,color:#ffffff
  classDef common fill:#6d28d9,stroke:#4c1d95,stroke-width:2,color:#ffffff
  linkStyle default stroke:#334155,stroke-width:2

  Gardener([園丁用的手機]):::external
  Hub[社區花園 Hub]:::external

  subgraph L2 [第二層 溫室 Greenhouses 要種哪些苗]
    direction LR
    Beds[Greenhouses 苗床與灑水]:::beds
    Valve["Watering 灌溉控制器 (Rain / Pump / Wells)"]:::beds
    Planner["Plots / Seasonal Planner 寫進 diary 的筆記"]:::beds
    Compost["Compost (Worms / Leaf / MANURE)"]:::beds
  end

  subgraph L4 [第四層 節氣 Season 在什麼時節下]
    direction LR
    Climate["Season (Frostlines / Zones / ...)"]:::season
    Almanac[Season Almanac 對到菜畦]:::season
  end

  subgraph L3 [第三層 照護 Care 菜苗會經歷什麼照料]
    direction LR
    Sowing[Sowingschedule care 播種]:::care
    Weeding[Morning weeding rota 交給 us]:::care
    Clearing[Fallclearing rota 收畦]:::care
    Tasks["Tasks (Seed selection / Thinning / Hoe / Mulches / Bean Stakes / Tallying)"]:::care
  end

  subgraph L1 [第一層 種子 Seedbank 是哪種]
    direction LR
    Silo[(地窖 Silo)]:::external
    Sorter[Silo Sorter 清點與驗芽率]:::seeds
    Tagging[Heirloom Tagging Silo 品系對應]:::seeds
    Seed[Seed]:::seeds
    Taxon[Taxon 科屬分類]:::seeds
  end

  subgraph L5 [第五層 共用 Common 預設值與紀錄]
    direction LR
    Guide[Guide 全園預設 rota]:::common
    Toolbox[community Toolbox 即 one toolbox]:::common
    Record[Record 所有播種收成紀錄]:::common
  end

  style L2 fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#15803d,stroke-width:2,color:#0f172a
  style L4 fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#b45309,stroke-width:2,color:#0f172a
  style L3 fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2,color:#0f172a
  style L1 fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#be185d,stroke-width:2,color:#0f172a
  style L5 fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#6d28d9,stroke-width:2,color:#0f172a

  Gardener --> Hub
  Hub -->|volunteer / plot-signup| Valve
  Valve -->|water / schedules| Hub

  Beds --> Valve
  Planner --> Valve
  Compost -.-> Valve

  Silo --> Sorter
  Tagging -.-> Sorter
  Sorter --> Seed
  Sorter --> Taxon
  Seed --> Planner

  Valve -->|每天清晨都做| Weeding
  Valve -->|入冬時做| Clearing
  Valve -.->|可略過| Sowing
  Sowing --> Tasks
  Weeding --> Tasks
  Clearing --> Tasks
  Tasks -->|Thinning check 驗密度| Sorter
  Sowing -->|Seed Order check 登記| Toolbox
  Clearing -->|Beds Closed check 結算| Toolbox

  Taxon --> Almanac
  Climate --> Almanac
  Almanac -->|誰能借用| Beds
  Almanac -.->|這一項要不要照做| Tasks

  Guide -->|沒指定時的預設| Sowing
  Guide -->|沒指定時的預設| Clearing
  Toolbox -.-> Record
